{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_09_j",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:aaa4280ae5ca9ee3ed0fbdf6ef4cfd52b40e282710f308892cc917d33fa12100",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c44f7bbc14689017f2844e743b9833293d7446e8de144cf221b18eaeffe53b0",
      "text": "啊～顺带一提，我也打算参加。\n总不能丢下硲先生不管嘛……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d30a3aeb4b7ecdccf993dd81be449bd74dfd2149295241722c33363318632d15",
      "text": "嚯。这样好吗？山下先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94aa530591bb2d6fba34280cc945f864cdedc1d091f2b15c95b6ae48f01424b3",
      "text": "正如你方才所言，这场LIVE\n恐怕不是那么容易对付的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f811af248b633dc4b52bb645fa305b709d4e12e70ca617b8127e27c3dc1fda23",
      "text": "哎，虽然是这样……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f29b90ab167753d386e0878da76a00ba7f4d162cc029ddfb2da2b46bcb3ede6",
      "text": "但正因如此，我觉得才更应该由大叔出马，\n而不是让年轻一辈去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40a41b3c87544f942ccbad7c86617406a43a26818df9c79cfa172d120c7e173b",
      "text": "我把这个阵容召集起来，\n也是出于这个原因呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:882784330b0c1d4a0b04b94becac5cefef11e6d14af2fd7b7f4a0bacad886194",
      "text": "次郎，真有你的！\n温柔、机敏，说得太好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0220bbfdc0065b4233fe79370ece92073eadbc243ad77d4efd8786d1bdb594bd",
      "text": "毕竟我们有岁月的阅历嘛♪\n我们这边可也不是好惹的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21f375c0ba89c8bfc16f949d4edafd8c6f86b070610a2f234c5a9021ed454b3f",
      "text": "前辈们干劲十足啊。\n那么，最后葛之叶怎么说？算你不参加？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bb4f8f11430da0b3c1dbd1155f2c5e1ca8823037baf1ba65ec996e9c57ed844",
      "text": "怎么可能。要是参加这场LIVE，\n想必也能顺势进入对方的地盘。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61cfd33bfaea128f7020b4673eaf7a615fbf10ec86aff16d68da3d59d64d6951",
      "text": "对我而言也是个绝佳的机会。我很乐意参加。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69b7cb5a457b8c438e3dd2cadd0454d3f51b6c2dd3b5a9044e74be7ea82ebad7",
      "text": "……决定了啊。\n这场可疑的LIVE，就由我们接下了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000177:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377",
      "text": "噢——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000195:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47ed3bfb741b0810834a9ed8e80258cb5eea41bf228195d039b99132825df5e5",
      "text": "那么，给制作人酱打个电话吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000215:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99338d16006635901de6ed40fb78c3f81f9b00654e2deeec50ac59e7705a5641",
      "text": "……喂，●●●●プロデューサー酱。\n现在方便说话吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000217:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:725dd8768edbfb99e16b9f6f736081ed3cc8a20fac01cd0625ecf1558249532c",
      "text": "其实啊，刚才在事务所听到制作人酱和\n贤聊的内容了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000219:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:830f77554968bfcb8d9213c91f4e2237d7db2f468b053e7d683b430a59fd1349",
      "text": "就是那个，前男极主办方\n发来LIVE邀请的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000221:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18b90517a70de1cf1cbe20b78070a6936ee78ac512115dd4e13068bd97a27ab6",
      "text": "哎呀～偷听了真是不好意思。那个，\n315 Pro这边是打算拒绝的对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000223:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9aa77f28102b48e7fba9d7dc1ee16fa2020bde0ec9faa79a7fac0783e8c65995",
      "text": "刚才还在和贤君\n商量这件事",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000226:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c985cd85ea03adc1bed5ae0a81a107a74545dfe661544c54a628e25519cafc12",
      "text": "这样啊。这么晚了还在为我们操心，谢谢啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000228:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:addc7b17cf0f568ca74e79a68b680630547e26148bbc2f342a3925e667f7f372",
      "text": "然后关于那场LIVE……\n现在我身边聚了一帮想出场的人哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000231:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:162311c027514ea2f3bab8f78dc026cfef07a6fee109ddaecc654ab35eb141d3",
      "text": "稍等一下哦。……来，大家～\n电话那头是制作人酱哦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000233:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfda9869f0bfd2ad6f85afc7d4a48ff7169324d01192c59a5bdf372f3d229bf1",
      "text": "想参加LIVE的人，答应一声～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000235:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a",
      "text": "在——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000237:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9455d6b55a0eb14c663b0b82eac96477a46bd5145106cbbf8fde6d5df7123d15",
      "text": "听到了吗？硲先生、渡边先生、\n信玄先生、葛之叶和我，一共5个人哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000239:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52ae5ea73b9293e218b326c993f6448e6bb7aa635a048a730983ae87722e8bb9",
      "text": "就是这样，有人想参加。\n明天在事务所，再详细聊聊吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000241:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:399925a6696de7788141bd709762b68f6bb8260cb01ae3fa4bf99f8ad2a34037",
      "text": "今天姑且就先辛苦啦。\n你们两个也早点回家休息吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000243:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:209d2d114e475e6b9101624586fbacee282840e1f1c93ea3f75b9b61cec49ca5",
      "text": "那，晚安咯。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
